    "summary": "When an enemy picks Fight phase targets, choose one targeted POXWALKERS unit. Once the attacker has finished, roll D6 per model from that unit killed by its attacks. Each 6 causes the attacker 1 mortal wound. If the chosen unit survives, treat enemy models killed by these wounds as casualties from the chosen unit’s attacks when applying their Curse ability.",
